  "contract": [
    "Non-null frame tables replace the active pointer; null retains it. Configure 0x7540 memory bytes, ignore its error for register loading, and load one of four lists for uint8 index<4.",
    "Zero memory size returns -5 without deinitializing. Otherwise deinitialize all function bits, ignore that return, then store the requested full word size and initialize.",
    "Any nonzero initialization byte bypasses initialization. For zero, read size before publishing the static pool pointer, reject zero size or any nonzero allocator result with -5, and write status 1 only on success. Callback changes otherwise remain live.",
    "Four typed register lists contain 48,1,1,1 pairs. All238 native bytes including descriptors and alignment match when symbols are placed at native addresses in probes."
  ],
