    "One new C unit owns the shared frame pointer,12-byte memory state,30016-byte pool, four typed lists and descriptor table. Future lifecycle work must share these owners.",
    "Native data addresses are probe placement only. Void return/caller scratch/private frames/APSR and out-of-contract non-uint8 indices excluded. Arbitrary requested sizes are forwarded in modeled tests; physical allocator writes, capacity behavior and buffer placement remain unverified.",
